1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,218
Formality is used for ionic solids like sodium chloride.

2
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:08,007
A crystal of salt has no molecules, only ions.

3
00:00:08,007 --> 00:00:10,976
Dissolve it, and the ions drift apart.

4
00:00:10,976 --> 00:00:19,531
So instead of moles of molecules, we count formula masses: fifty eight point five grams made up to one litre is one formal.

